OL,3,GNEWSAPaedophile sentenced for nursery
OL,4,Ajob email fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former nursery worker jailed for
OL,7,Fpossessing indecent images of children
OL,8,Fhas been sentenced for faking
OL,9,Freferences to get another job in
OL,10,Fchildcare.
OL,12,FKristian Parry, 27, was jailed in March
OL,13,Ffor possessing more than 5,000 images
OL,14,Fwhile working at a nursery in Leeds.
OL,16,FFollowing his conviction it emerged he
OL,17,Fhad applied for a job at another
OL,18,Fnursery after his arrest, using fake
OL,19,Femail addresses to send bogus
OL,20,Freferences to secure employment.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
